[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l013","ordinal":113409,"en":"He who made you masters of treasure,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l014","ordinal":113410,"en":"Alas, your khan Manas is gone."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l015","ordinal":113411,"en":"Bereft of Khan Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l016","ordinal":113412,"en":"Think, forty companions:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l017","ordinal":113413,"en":"You have no time for games."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l018","ordinal":113414,"en":"When the merry dawn broke,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l019","ordinal":113415,"en":"You forty companions made merry,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l020","ordinal":113416,"en":"Kymyz by day and girls by night,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l021","ordinal":113417,"en":"Laughing and playing all the while."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l022","ordinal":113418,"en":"Those warriors who came from Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l023","ordinal":113419,"en":"With valiant, gray-maned Manas—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l024","ordinal":113420,"en":"Those men who claimed kinship—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l025","ordinal":113421,"en":"Have eaten his well-nourished foal."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l026","ordinal":113422,"en":"Spurring on and fighting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l027","ordinal":113423,"en":"They claimed to be his brothers of equal birth!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l028","ordinal":113424,"en":"Unsuspecting, gray-maned Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l029","ordinal":113425,"en":"They repeatedly invited to feast"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l030","ordinal":113426,"en":"And gave a poison that silenced him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l031","ordinal":113427,"en":"Noble Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l032","ordinal":113428,"en":"Standing by the sultan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l033","ordinal":113429,"en":"While they scattered his treasure,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l034","ordinal":113430,"en":"Carried the generous lord away"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l035","ordinal":113431,"en":"And fled toward Mecca—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l036","ordinal":113432,"en":"Such scattered rumors reach me."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l037","ordinal":113433,"en":"With life barely in him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l038","ordinal":113434,"en":"Akayar began to speak."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0479:b004:l039","ordinal":113435,"en":"Manas the Lion, that noble hero—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l001","ordinal":113436,"en":"With his life hanging between death and life,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l002","ordinal":113437,"en":"Kanykei carried him away,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l003","ordinal":113438,"en":"And went to Mecca, I hear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l004","ordinal":113439,"en":"God knows whether King Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l005","ordinal":113440,"en":"Met his death and died;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l006","ordinal":113441,"en":"God knows whether Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l007","ordinal":113442,"en":"Has seen the face of Judgment,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l008","ordinal":113443,"en":"Or God knows whether Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l009","ordinal":113444,"en":"Healing her Magnanimous One,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l010","ordinal":113445,"en":"Will bring him back alive!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l011","ordinal":113446,"en":"Indeed, Manas the wolf-man's"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l012","ordinal":113447,"en":"Own kinsman became his enemy;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l013","ordinal":113448,"en":"He would not heed Kanykei's words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l014","ordinal":113449,"en":"And your fierce leopard Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l015","ordinal":113450,"en":"Was left with grief within."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l016","ordinal":113451,"en":"Their gold was worth less than iron;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l017","ordinal":113452,"en":"Fattened, they knew not what they had received."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l018","ordinal":113453,"en":"They plundered his wealth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l019","ordinal":113454,"en":"They truly wrought havoc."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l020","ordinal":113455,"en":"The warrior in Talas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l021","ordinal":113456,"en":"They broke into his treasury,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l022","ordinal":113457,"en":"Cut down his plane-tree and felled it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l023","ordinal":113458,"en":"Struck down the watchman,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l024","ordinal":113459,"en":"The treasury's riches to Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l025","ordinal":113460,"en":"They loaded them as booty."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l026","ordinal":113461,"en":"The God who strikes has struck them;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l027","ordinal":113462,"en":"Kokchokoz and Kozkaman"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l028","ordinal":113463,"en":"Have made such a spectacle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l029","ordinal":113464,"en":"My Talas, left deserted,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l030","ordinal":113465,"en":"May my Manas be safe!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l031","ordinal":113466,"en":"Was Kanykei struck"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l032","ordinal":113467,"en":"By Kozkaman's spear?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l033","ordinal":113468,"en":"Bereft of the mighty lion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l034","ordinal":113469,"en":"What will they do here,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l035","ordinal":113470,"en":"The forty companions, what recourse have they?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l036","ordinal":113471,"en":"Calling the fugitive our kinsman,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l037","ordinal":113472,"en":"Have we seen the benefit of this Chinese man?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l038","ordinal":113473,"en":"Finding words in sudden danger,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b003:l039","ordinal":113474,"en":"Finding sight in darkness,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l001","ordinal":113475,"en":"Unrestrainable when angered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l002","ordinal":113476,"en":"Traveling a road in darkness,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l003","ordinal":113477,"en":"Set upon a corsac fox's track, never straying,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l004","ordinal":113478,"en":"The benefit of your sainthood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l005","ordinal":113479,"en":"Pledged to twelve spiritual guides,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l006","ordinal":113480,"en":"My destroyer Bakai, where are you?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l007","ordinal":113481,"en":"My Sereg, bearer of the banner,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l008","ordinal":113482,"en":"The one my very soul needs,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l009","ordinal":113483,"en":"My noble falcon has met calamity;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l010","ordinal":113484,"en":"Have you seen Kozkaman's gift?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l011","ordinal":113485,"en":"My Chubak, Akbaltai's son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l012","ordinal":113486,"en":"My broad-chested, unfortunate one,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l013","ordinal":113487,"en":"Against the Kara-Kalmyks who have come,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l014","ordinal":113488,"en":"It is time for you to strike at full stretch."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l015","ordinal":113489,"en":"Riding a horse like Sarala,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l016","ordinal":113490,"en":"Wearing trousers of yellow hide,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l017","ordinal":113491,"en":"Carrying a spear without a tassel,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l018","ordinal":113492,"en":"Girding a bare sword at your side,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l019","ordinal":113493,"en":"Pure in the Prophet-sultan's faith,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l020","ordinal":113494,"en":"A golden throne left in Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l021","ordinal":113495,"en":"Never looking back on a campaign,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l022","ordinal":113496,"en":"You were a lion who never grieved;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l023","ordinal":113497,"en":"The Kara-Kalmyks with their distant roads,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l024","ordinal":113498,"en":"You were the warrior who knew their way."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l025","ordinal":113499,"en":"Girding your mighty waist,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l026","ordinal":113500,"en":"Stern, without a smile,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l027","ordinal":113501,"en":"If seven vast multitudes of enemies came,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l028","ordinal":113502,"en":"With your coat thrown on, you charged and struck."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l029","ordinal":113503,"en":"Valiant Almam, my fierce one,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l030","ordinal":113504,"en":"A damned day has fallen upon us;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l031","ordinal":113505,"en":"Upon Manas, blessed by Kydyr,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l032","ordinal":113506,"en":"A pitiless night of hell has fallen."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l033","ordinal":113507,"en":"Without sending out scouts, we came to grief;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l034","ordinal":113508,"en":"We have lost your leopard-lion, King Manas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l036","ordinal":113509,"en":"The help of my valiant one,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l037","ordinal":113510,"en":"When will I see, O leopard,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l038","ordinal":113511,"en":"My Alake's resourcefulness?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0480:b004:l039","ordinal":113512,"en":"The time to confront them has come,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l001","ordinal":113513,"en":"When will I see you, Alake?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l002","ordinal":113514,"en":"The time to go has come."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l003","ordinal":113515,"en":"My Almam, blessed by Kydyr, listen;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l004","ordinal":113516,"en":"The time for mortal combat has come."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l005","ordinal":113517,"en":"Yesterday, the finest of sixty,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l006","ordinal":113518,"en":"The mightiest of forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l007","ordinal":113519,"en":"The worth of them all,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l008","ordinal":113520,"en":"The heart of the Islamic faith,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l009","ordinal":113521,"en":"The binding ring of sharp steel;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l010","ordinal":113522,"en":"Never withdrawing what he thrust forward,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l011","ordinal":113523,"en":"Never fleeing the glowering enemy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l012","ordinal":113524,"en":"My edge of black steel,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l013","ordinal":113525,"en":"We have lost the bloodstained lion!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l014","ordinal":113526,"en":"Dead or alive, who knows?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l015","ordinal":113527,"en":"The one Creator alone knows!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l016","ordinal":113528,"en":"Syrgak, you were the leopard,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l017","ordinal":113529,"en":"You were the lion who never grieved."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l018","ordinal":113530,"en":"If the bloodstained leopard's eyes closed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l019","ordinal":113531,"en":"You were the one to take his place."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l021","ordinal":113532,"en":"Girding yourself to fight alone,","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l022","ordinal":113533,"en":"My Syrgak, take vengeance on the five Kalmyks!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l024","ordinal":113534,"en":"Breaking up and trampling their games,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l025","ordinal":113535,"en":"Kyrgylchal stirred them up,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l026","ordinal":113536,"en":"Reproaching the forty companions."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l027","ordinal":113537,"en":"Hearing Kyrgylchal's words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l028","ordinal":113538,"en":"That forty Kalmyks had brought his downfall,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l029","ordinal":113539,"en":"And had fled to Beijing, so they heard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l030","ordinal":113540,"en":"At that time the forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l031","ordinal":113541,"en":"Making Talas their homeland,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l032","ordinal":113542,"en":"Had settled there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l033","ordinal":113543,"en":"Swollen like blue ticks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l034","ordinal":113544,"en":"They had grown plump."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l035","ordinal":113545,"en":"Each of them was as a countless army,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l036","ordinal":113546,"en":"Such had they become."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l037","ordinal":113547,"en":"Finding no mountain to charge,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l038","ordinal":113548,"en":"At that time the forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b003:l039","ordinal":113549,"en":"Finding no enemy to fight,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l001","ordinal":113550,"en":"Finding no embers to wade through,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l002","ordinal":113551,"en":"Finding no bullets to exchange,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l003","ordinal":113552,"en":"Finding no mountain to strike and die upon,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l004","ordinal":113553,"en":"Finding no enemy to clash with,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l005","ordinal":113554,"en":"King Manas's nobles of the hills,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l006","ordinal":113555,"en":"Had entered the caliph's presence and received a letter,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l007","ordinal":113556,"en":"Received a blessing from the prince,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l008","ordinal":113557,"en":"Pledged themselves to twelve spiritual guides,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l009","ordinal":113558,"en":"And been named illustrious champions."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l010","ordinal":113559,"en":"Raging, unable to sleep,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l011","ordinal":113560,"en":"Their two eyes aflame,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l012","ordinal":113561,"en":"They shone fiercely."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l013","ordinal":113562,"en":"Spear and sword, six times,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l014","ordinal":113563,"en":"They were sharpening them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l015","ordinal":113564,"en":"Not thinning after six months' riding,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l016","ordinal":113565,"en":"Each had a swift steed"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l017","ordinal":113566,"en":"Tethered and ready."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l018","ordinal":113567,"en":"The armor Kanykei made, impenetrable to bullets,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l019","ordinal":113568,"en":"Each of them, without exception,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l020","ordinal":113569,"en":"Was ready to wear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l021","ordinal":113570,"en":"Let alone the five, Beijing itself"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l022","ordinal":113571,"en":"They were ready to attack;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l023","ordinal":113572,"en":"It was time to wade through bullets,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l025","ordinal":113573,"en":"Toward the tethered steeds,","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l026","ordinal":113574,"en":"Grieving at the news of Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l027","ordinal":113575,"en":"All the valiant, fierce ones"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l028","ordinal":113576,"en":"Ran in haste."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l029","ordinal":113577,"en":"Hurriedly they said their prayers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l030","ordinal":113578,"en":"Saddled their swift steeds,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l031","ordinal":113579,"en":"Made their battle gear ready,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l032","ordinal":113580,"en":"Their spears, guns and swords"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l033","ordinal":113581,"en":"They fastened in their proper places."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l034","ordinal":113582,"en":"Banners fluttered in their hands,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l035","ordinal":113583,"en":"Zulpukor of sharp steel"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l036","ordinal":113584,"en":"Flashed in every hand."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l037","ordinal":113585,"en":"Their belts with cartridge pouches"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l038","ordinal":113586,"en":"They fastened across the outside,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0481:b005:l039","ordinal":113587,"en":"Their eyes shining like fire,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l001","ordinal":113588,"en":"They beat the drums,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l002","ordinal":113589,"en":"All alike toward the enemy"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l003","ordinal":113590,"en":"They stood making ready."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l004","ordinal":113591,"en":"The forty companions, Manas's wings,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l005","ordinal":113592,"en":"Their number some sixty,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l006","ordinal":113593,"en":"Crushing the enemy they faced,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l007","ordinal":113594,"en":"Those blood-shedders were accustomed to bring torment."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l009","ordinal":113595,"en":"They streamed along in ordered ranks;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l010","ordinal":113596,"en":"The two khans, Azhybai and Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l011","ordinal":113597,"en":"These two bore the banners."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l012","ordinal":113598,"en":"Almambet and Chubak, the twin warriors,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l013","ordinal":113599,"en":"These alone went scouting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l014","ordinal":113600,"en":"Syrgak and Sergek, the pair,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l015","ordinal":113601,"en":"Shuutu the slave and the Singer together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l016","ordinal":113602,"en":"Baichoro and the Diviner,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l017","ordinal":113603,"en":"Ormombek, Odukan's son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l018","ordinal":113604,"en":"The youngest, headed by Bozuulu,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l019","ordinal":113605,"en":"Kyrgylchal, head of the forty,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l020","ordinal":113606,"en":"The mighty wrestler Tazbaimat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l021","ordinal":113607,"en":"Akzholtoi, Adykan's son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l022","ordinal":113608,"en":"Mingled together, hastening on their way,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l023","ordinal":113609,"en":"Each like an immeasurable army."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l024","ordinal":113610,"en":"One of the forty companions"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l025","ordinal":113611,"en":"Was a lion skilled among spearmen."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l026","ordinal":113612,"en":"One of the forty companions"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l027","ordinal":113613,"en":"Was a mighty lion who struck with a battle-axe."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l028","ordinal":113614,"en":"Do not ask about the forty companions;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l029","ordinal":113615,"en":"They drank their fill of dark blood."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l030","ordinal":113616,"en":"If the raging battle was great,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l031","ordinal":113617,"en":"They fought six months without fleeing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l032","ordinal":113618,"en":"They did not shrink from death,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l033","ordinal":113619,"en":"They did not flee the enemy they faced."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l034","ordinal":113620,"en":"King Manas's forty nobles,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l035","ordinal":113621,"en":"Wearing marten fur and black caps,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l036","ordinal":113622,"en":"Tall in stature, broad of shoulder,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l037","ordinal":113623,"en":"Wrestlers and lions alike,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l038","ordinal":113624,"en":"All fearless champions."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b003:l039","ordinal":113625,"en":"All the forty companions"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l001","ordinal":113626,"en":"Traveled up the Talas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l002","ordinal":113627,"en":"Sparing no horses, covering much ground,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l003","ordinal":113628,"en":"The lions hurried on."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l004","ordinal":113629,"en":"“This is the road they will take,” they said,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l005","ordinal":113630,"en":"And crossed Kotormo,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l006","ordinal":113631,"en":"And traversed Suusamyr."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l007","ordinal":113632,"en":"They journeyed as far as Urchuk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l008","ordinal":113633,"en":"Sparing no horses, hey, covering much ground,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l009","ordinal":113634,"en":"Without looking far ahead for scouts, hey,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l010","ordinal":113635,"en":"Without sparing their swift steeds, hey."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l011","ordinal":113636,"en":"In some places, hey, the forty companions"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l012","ordinal":113637,"en":"Clashed stirrups as they raced."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l013","ordinal":113638,"en":"In some places, the forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l014","ordinal":113639,"en":"All on renowned swift steeds,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l015","ordinal":113640,"en":"Struggled against their horses' mouths."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l016","ordinal":113641,"en":"All the swift, noble-bred horses"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l017","ordinal":113642,"en":"Shattered the ground they trod;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l018","ordinal":113643,"en":"Clods as big as great cauldrons"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l019","ordinal":113644,"en":"Over the forty companions' heads"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l020","ordinal":113645,"en":"Were tossed like jacks, rattling."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l021","ordinal":113646,"en":"Making for the foothills, they traveled,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l022","ordinal":113647,"en":"Sparing no horses, hey, covering much ground."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l023","ordinal":113648,"en":"They crossed bulging hollows and deep ravines,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l024","ordinal":113649,"en":"They crossed the looming high mountain."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l026","ordinal":113650,"en":"A broad plain covered in fescue,","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l027","ordinal":113651,"en":"Then they crossed that broad plain."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l028","ordinal":113652,"en":"Traveling through the great mountains,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l029","ordinal":113653,"en":"Resourceful Bakai, your khan uncle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l030","ordinal":113654,"en":"Sparing no horses, hey, covering much ground,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l031","ordinal":113655,"en":"To Eki-Chat of Echki-Olbos, hey,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l032","ordinal":113656,"en":"They crossed over and lay down, hey."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l034","ordinal":113657,"en":"Turning toward the forty companions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l035","ordinal":113658,"en":"Kydyr-blessed Bakai, the noble lion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l036","ordinal":113659,"en":"Spoke his precious words:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l037","ordinal":113660,"en":"“Have the fugitives made camp without delay?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l038","ordinal":113661,"en":"Your father's grave, forty nobles!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l039","ordinal":113662,"en":"Has your moment to be needed come?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0483:b003:l001","ordinal":113663,"en":"Have the vanished fugitives camped here?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0483:b003:l003","ordinal":113664,"en":"Forty companions, has your expedition prospered?"}]
